From e001e41a41df288f2eefb861a62962ed6dd582f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 20:55:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/14] Add save backend for batteryless repro carts (REPRO=1
 build)

Serves the AgbFlash API from the save area in cart ROM, keeps a working
copy in the cart's banked SRAM and commits it to the ROM flash after each
phase of a link save. Board probing and flash sequences mirror the
batteryless code on bootleg carts. The default build is unchanged and
still matches.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014JPQshc9oBXnzvR2E67Khm
